# Project Rules - JC7 Judo Club MVP

## Project Context
Build a web application for JC7 (Judo Courneuvien 7), a judo club.

Primary goal:
digitize registrations, payments, and reduce manual admin work.

This is an MVP.
Prioritize simplicity and fast delivery.

Public website:
- landing page
- registration page
- Stripe checkout payment flow

Admin dashboard:
- secure login
- registrations table
- CRUD registrations
- search
- filtering
- sorting
- CSV / Excel export

Do not add extra features unless explicitly requested.

---

## Business Context
Target users:
- parents registering children
- adult members
- club administrators

Main problem solved:
replace paper/manual registration workflows.

---

## Architecture Rules

Separate concerns strictly.

### Business Data (Supabase)
Use Supabase for:
- registrations
- users
- authentication
- payments status
- future attendance

Never store business data elsewhere.

---

### Content Data (future Strapi)
Prepare architecture for future CMS integration.

Future content examples:
- homepage editable text
- club presentation
- blog/news
- gallery
- events
- FAQ
- partners

Future CMS:
- https://strapi.io

Do not implement Strapi now.
Only prepare for future integration.

