## Database Schema

Table: registrations

Fields:
- id (uuid)
- first_name
- last_name
- birth_date
- email
- phone
- emergency_contact
- category
- medical_note (optional)
- payment_status (pending | paid | cancelled)
- stripe_session_id (optional)
- created_at

Indexes:
- email
- payment_status
- created_at

Use migrations only.
Never manually edit production tables.

